editor_description = "Gust playground (Stage 6). Left: floating test targets to gust from every direction (they flash, get knocked away and count hits). Right: a ledge 36 px above the floor, across a spike pit; a full jump (30 px) falls short, a jump + down-gust at the top makes it. A side-gust backward also stretches the jump. The wind crystal over the pit refills dash/breath AND the down-gust boosts. F3 draws the gust hitbox."
